window.__code__ = window.__code__ || {};
window.__code__["backend-py"] = {"code_id": "backend-py", "kind": "src", "title": "_backend.py", "source_path": "agentscope/src/agentscope/tool/_builtin/_backend.py", "highlight_line": null, "code_html": "<div class=\"code-body\">\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"1\"><span class=\"c-no\">1</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"2\"><span class=\"c-no\">2</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Backend abstraction <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> builtin tools.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"3\"><span class=\"c-no\">3</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"4\"><span class=\"c-no\">4</span><span class=\"c-src\">Provides a :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`BackendBase` abstract base <span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> that captures the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"5\"><span class=\"c-no\">5</span><span class=\"c-src\">core I/O primitives shared across all six builtin tools (Bash, Read,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"6\"><span class=\"c-no\">6</span><span class=\"c-src\">Write, Edit, Grep, Glob).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"7\"><span class=\"c-no\">7</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"8\"><span class=\"c-no\">8</span><span class=\"c-src\">Every backend implements exactly **three** abstract primitives whose</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"9\"><span class=\"c-no\">9</span><span class=\"c-src\">mechanism genuinely differs per environment:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"10\"><span class=\"c-no\">10</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"11\"><span class=\"c-no\">11</span><span class=\"c-src\">* :meth:`BackendBase.exec_shell` — run a program <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> an argv list</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"12\"><span class=\"c-no\">12</span><span class=\"c-src\">  (no shell; callers needing shell features wrap <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> ``sh -c``).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"13\"><span class=\"c-no\">13</span><span class=\"c-src\">* :meth:`BackendBase.read_file` — read raw bytes.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"14\"><span class=\"c-no\">14</span><span class=\"c-src\">* :meth:`BackendBase.write_file` — write raw bytes.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"15\"><span class=\"c-no\">15</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"16\"><span class=\"c-no\">16</span><span class=\"c-src\">All remaining filesystem operations (``file_exists``, ``is_dir``,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"17\"><span class=\"c-no\">17</span><span class=\"c-src\">``list_dir``, ``stat_mtime``, ``delete_path``) are derived on the base</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"18\"><span class=\"c-no\">18</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> ``exec_shell`` <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> work out-of-the-box <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> any remote</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"19\"><span class=\"c-no\">19</span><span class=\"c-src\">backend.  A backend that has a cheaper native path (e.g.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"20\"><span class=\"c-no\">20</span><span class=\"c-src\">:<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`LocalBackend` using ``os.*``) simply overrides them.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"21\"><span class=\"c-no\">21</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"22\"><span class=\"c-no\">22</span><span class=\"c-src\">Concrete implementations:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"23\"><span class=\"c-no\">23</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"24\"><span class=\"c-no\">24</span><span class=\"c-src\">* :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`LocalBackend` — default; uses ``asyncio`` subprocesses,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"25\"><span class=\"c-no\">25</span><span class=\"c-src\">  ``aiofiles``, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> ``os.*`` <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> host-local I/O.  Injected automatically</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"26\"><span class=\"c-no\">26</span><span class=\"c-src\">  when no explicit backend <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> given.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"27\"><span class=\"c-no\">27</span><span class=\"c-src\">* ``DockerBackend`` — uses ``aiodocker`` exec / archive APIs.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"28\"><span class=\"c-no\">28</span><span class=\"c-src\">* ``E2BBackend`` — uses the E2B SDK ``commands`` / ``files`` APIs.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"29\"><span class=\"c-no\">29</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"30\"><span class=\"c-no\">30</span><span class=\"c-src\">By accepting a ``BackendBase`` parameter, each builtin tool can</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"31\"><span class=\"c-no\">31</span><span class=\"c-src\">operate identically <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> local, Docker, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> E2B workspaces without any</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"32\"><span class=\"c-no\">32</span><span class=\"c-src\">workspace-specific branching inside the tool code itself.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"33\"><span class=\"c-no\">33</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"34\"><span class=\"c-no\">34</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"35\"><span class=\"c-no\">35</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> __future__ <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> annotations</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"36\"><span class=\"c-no\">36</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"37\"><span class=\"c-no\">37</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> asyncio</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"38\"><span class=\"c-no\">38</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> os</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"39\"><span class=\"c-no\">39</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> posixpath</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"40\"><span class=\"c-no\">40</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> shlex</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"41\"><span class=\"c-no\">41</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> shutil</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"42\"><span class=\"c-no\">42</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> abc <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> ABC, abstractmethod</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"43\"><span class=\"c-no\">43</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> dataclasses <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> dataclass</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"44\"><span class=\"c-no\">44</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> types <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> ModuleType</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"45\"><span class=\"c-no\">45</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> typing <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> Any</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"46\"><span class=\"c-no\">46</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"47\"><span class=\"c-no\">47</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> aiofiles</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"48\"><span class=\"c-no\">48</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"49\"><span class=\"c-no\">49</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># ── data class ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"50\"><span class=\"c-no\">50</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"51\"><span class=\"c-no\">51</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"52\"><span class=\"c-no\">52</span><span class=\"c-src\">@dataclass(frozen=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>, slots=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"53\"><span class=\"c-no\">53</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> ExecResult:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"54\"><span class=\"c-no\">54</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Result of running a shell command via a backend.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"55\"><span class=\"c-no\">55</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"56\"><span class=\"c-no\">56</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Attributes:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"57\"><span class=\"c-no\">57</span><span class=\"c-src\">        exit_code: Process exit code.  ``-1`` conventionally indicates</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"58\"><span class=\"c-no\">58</span><span class=\"c-src\">            an internal failure (timeout, connection error, …).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"59\"><span class=\"c-no\">59</span><span class=\"c-src\">        stdout: Raw bytes captured <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> standard output.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"60\"><span class=\"c-no\">60</span><span class=\"c-src\">        stderr: Raw bytes captured <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> standard error.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"61\"><span class=\"c-no\">61</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"62\"><span class=\"c-no\">62</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"63\"><span class=\"c-no\">63</span><span class=\"c-src\">    exit_code: int</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"64\"><span class=\"c-no\">64</span><span class=\"c-src\">    stdout: bytes</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"65\"><span class=\"c-no\">65</span><span class=\"c-src\">    stderr: bytes</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"66\"><span class=\"c-no\">66</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"67\"><span class=\"c-no\">67</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> ok(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"68\"><span class=\"c-no\">68</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Whether the command exited successfully.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"69\"><span class=\"c-no\">69</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"70\"><span class=\"c-no\">70</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"71\"><span class=\"c-no\">71</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bool`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"72\"><span class=\"c-no\">72</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` iff the command exited <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> code ``0``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"73\"><span class=\"c-no\">73</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"74\"><span class=\"c-no\">74</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.exit_code == 0</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"75\"><span class=\"c-no\">75</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"76\"><span class=\"c-no\">76</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"77\"><span class=\"c-no\">77</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># ── helpers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"78\"><span class=\"c-no\">78</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"79\"><span class=\"c-no\">79</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"80\"><span class=\"c-no\">80</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _normalize_newlines(text: str) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"81\"><span class=\"c-no\">81</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Normalize Windows/old-Mac line endings to ``\\\\n``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"82\"><span class=\"c-no\">82</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"83\"><span class=\"c-no\">83</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Converts ``\\\\r\\\\n`` (Windows) <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> lone ``\\\\r`` (classic Mac) to a</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"84\"><span class=\"c-no\">84</span><span class=\"c-src\">    single ``\\\\n``.  Builtin tools read files <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> raw bytes (so binary</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"85\"><span class=\"c-no\">85</span><span class=\"c-src\">    payloads survive intact); when the bytes are decoded <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> text <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"86\"><span class=\"c-no\">86</span><span class=\"c-src\">    line-based caching, editing, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> matching, the line endings must be</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"87\"><span class=\"c-no\">87</span><span class=\"c-src\">    normalized so that content written on Windows behaves identically to</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"88\"><span class=\"c-no\">88</span><span class=\"c-src\">    content written on POSIX.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"89\"><span class=\"c-no\">89</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"90\"><span class=\"c-no\">90</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"91\"><span class=\"c-no\">91</span><span class=\"c-src\">        text (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"92\"><span class=\"c-no\">92</span><span class=\"c-src\">            Decoded file contents.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"93\"><span class=\"c-no\">93</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"94\"><span class=\"c-no\">94</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"95\"><span class=\"c-no\">95</span><span class=\"c-src\">        `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"96\"><span class=\"c-no\">96</span><span class=\"c-src\">            The text <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> all line endings collapsed to ``\\\\n``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"97\"><span class=\"c-no\">97</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"98\"><span class=\"c-no\">98</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> text.replace(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;\\r\\n&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span>).replace(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;\\r&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;\\n&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"99\"><span class=\"c-no\">99</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"100\"><span class=\"c-no\">100</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"101\"><span class=\"c-no\">101</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># ── base class ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"102\"><span class=\"c-no\">102</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"103\"><span class=\"c-no\">103</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"104\"><span class=\"c-no\">104</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> BackendBase(ABC):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"105\"><span class=\"c-no\">105</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Filesystem + subprocess interface consumed by builtin tools.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"106\"><span class=\"c-no\">106</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"107\"><span class=\"c-no\">107</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Subclasses must implement three abstract primitives — ``exec_shell``,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"108\"><span class=\"c-no\">108</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ``read_file``, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> ``write_file`` — which are the only operations</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"109\"><span class=\"c-no\">109</span><span class=\"c-src\">    whose mechanism genuinely differs per environment.  The remaining</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"110\"><span class=\"c-no\">110</span><span class=\"c-src\">    filesystem helpers are implemented here on top of ``exec_shell`` <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"111\"><span class=\"c-no\">111</span><span class=\"c-src\">    work <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> any backend whose shell <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> POSIX-like; a backend <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> a</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"112\"><span class=\"c-no\">112</span><span class=\"c-src\">    cheaper native path may override them (see :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`LocalBackend`).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"113\"><span class=\"c-no\">113</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"114\"><span class=\"c-no\">114</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"115\"><span class=\"c-no\">115</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: Path-manipulation module whose semantics match the backend&#x27;s</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"116\"><span class=\"c-no\">116</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: environment.  Used by :meth:`join_path`, :meth:`dirname`,</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"117\"><span class=\"c-no\">117</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: :meth:`isabs`, :meth:`normpath`, and :meth:`abspath` to ensure</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"118\"><span class=\"c-no\">118</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: correct behavior when the host OS and the backend OS differ</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"119\"><span class=\"c-no\">119</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: (e.g. a Windows host driving a Linux Docker container).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"120\"><span class=\"c-no\">120</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"121\"><span class=\"c-no\">121</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: Defaults to :mod:`posixpath`, which is correct for any backend</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"122\"><span class=\"c-no\">122</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: whose environment is Linux/macOS (Docker, E2B, …).  Subclasses</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"123\"><span class=\"c-no\">123</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: targeting a different environment override this attribute, e.g.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"124\"><span class=\"c-no\">124</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: :class:`LocalBackend` sets it to :mod:`os.path`, and a future</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"125\"><span class=\"c-no\">125</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: Windows-container backend would set it to :mod:`ntpath`.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"126\"><span class=\"c-no\">126</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"127\"><span class=\"c-no\">127</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#: .. important::</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"128\"><span class=\"c-no\">128</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"129\"><span class=\"c-no\">129</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     Only **pure string operations** on this module are safe to</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"130\"><span class=\"c-no\">130</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     call (``join``, ``split``, ``dirname``, ``basename``,</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"131\"><span class=\"c-no\">131</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     ``normpath``, ``isabs``, ``splitext``, ``splitdrive``, …).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"132\"><span class=\"c-no\">132</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"133\"><span class=\"c-no\">133</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     Do **not** call functions that touch the filesystem or</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"134\"><span class=\"c-no\">134</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     environment variables — ``exists``, ``isfile``, ``isdir``,</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"135\"><span class=\"c-no\">135</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     ``getmtime``, ``realpath``, ``expanduser``, ``expandvars``,</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"136\"><span class=\"c-no\">136</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     and parameterless ``abspath`` — because those read the</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"137\"><span class=\"c-no\">137</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     **host** process&#x27;s filesystem / ``$HOME`` / ``cwd``, which</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"138\"><span class=\"c-no\">138</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     is meaningless (and a silent bug) for remote backends.  Use</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"139\"><span class=\"c-no\">139</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     the async I/O methods on the backend instead</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"140\"><span class=\"c-no\">140</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     (:meth:`file_exists`, :meth:`is_dir`, :meth:`stat_mtime`,</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"141\"><span class=\"c-no\">141</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     …) or the :meth:`abspath` wrapper below, which requires an</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"142\"><span class=\"c-no\">142</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\">#:     explicit ``cwd`` argument.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"143\"><span class=\"c-no\">143</span><span class=\"c-src\">    _path_module: ModuleType = posixpath</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"144\"><span class=\"c-no\">144</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"145\"><span class=\"c-no\">145</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ── path manipulation helpers (pure string ops) ────────────────</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"146\"><span class=\"c-no\">146</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"147\"><span class=\"c-no\">147</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> join_path(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str, *paths: str) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"148\"><span class=\"c-no\">148</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Join one <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> more path components using the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s separator.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"149\"><span class=\"c-no\">149</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"150\"><span class=\"c-no\">150</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"151\"><span class=\"c-no\">151</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"152\"><span class=\"c-no\">152</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The first path component.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"153\"><span class=\"c-no\">153</span><span class=\"c-src\">            *paths (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"154\"><span class=\"c-no\">154</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Additional components to join onto ``path``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"155\"><span class=\"c-no\">155</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"156\"><span class=\"c-no\">156</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"157\"><span class=\"c-no\">157</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"158\"><span class=\"c-no\">158</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The joined path, using the backend environment&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s path</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"159\"><span class=\"c-no\">159</span><span class=\"c-src\">                separator.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"160\"><span class=\"c-no\">160</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"161\"><span class=\"c-no\">161</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.join(path, *paths)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"162\"><span class=\"c-no\">162</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"163\"><span class=\"c-no\">163</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> dirname(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"164\"><span class=\"c-no\">164</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return the directory component of ``path``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"165\"><span class=\"c-no\">165</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"166\"><span class=\"c-no\">166</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"167\"><span class=\"c-no\">167</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"168\"><span class=\"c-no\">168</span><span class=\"c-src\">                A path inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"169\"><span class=\"c-no\">169</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"170\"><span class=\"c-no\">170</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"171\"><span class=\"c-no\">171</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"172\"><span class=\"c-no\">172</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Everything up to (but <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> including) the last path</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"173\"><span class=\"c-no\">173</span><span class=\"c-src\">                separator. Empty string <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ``path`` has no separator.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"174\"><span class=\"c-no\">174</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"175\"><span class=\"c-no\">175</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.dirname(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"176\"><span class=\"c-no\">176</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"177\"><span class=\"c-no\">177</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> basename(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"178\"><span class=\"c-no\">178</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return the final component of ``path``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"179\"><span class=\"c-no\">179</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"180\"><span class=\"c-no\">180</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"181\"><span class=\"c-no\">181</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"182\"><span class=\"c-no\">182</span><span class=\"c-src\">                A path inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"183\"><span class=\"c-no\">183</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"184\"><span class=\"c-no\">184</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"185\"><span class=\"c-no\">185</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"186\"><span class=\"c-no\">186</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Everything after the last path separator. Empty string</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"187\"><span class=\"c-no\">187</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ``path`` ends <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> a separator.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"188\"><span class=\"c-no\">188</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"189\"><span class=\"c-no\">189</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.basename(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"190\"><span class=\"c-no\">190</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"191\"><span class=\"c-no\">191</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> isabs(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"192\"><span class=\"c-no\">192</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ``path`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> absolute <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> the backend.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"193\"><span class=\"c-no\">193</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"194\"><span class=\"c-no\">194</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"195\"><span class=\"c-no\">195</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"196\"><span class=\"c-no\">196</span><span class=\"c-src\">                A path inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"197\"><span class=\"c-no\">197</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"198\"><span class=\"c-no\">198</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"199\"><span class=\"c-no\">199</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bool`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"200\"><span class=\"c-no\">200</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` iff ``path`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> absolute under the backend</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"201\"><span class=\"c-no\">201</span><span class=\"c-src\">                environment&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s path semantics.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"202\"><span class=\"c-no\">202</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"203\"><span class=\"c-no\">203</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.isabs(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"204\"><span class=\"c-no\">204</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"205\"><span class=\"c-no\">205</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> normpath(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"206\"><span class=\"c-no\">206</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Normalize ``path`` (collapse ``..``, ``.``, duplicate seps).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"207\"><span class=\"c-no\">207</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"208\"><span class=\"c-no\">208</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Pure string operation — does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> touch the filesystem.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"209\"><span class=\"c-no\">209</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"210\"><span class=\"c-no\">210</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"211\"><span class=\"c-no\">211</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"212\"><span class=\"c-no\">212</span><span class=\"c-src\">                A path inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"213\"><span class=\"c-no\">213</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"214\"><span class=\"c-no\">214</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"215\"><span class=\"c-no\">215</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"216\"><span class=\"c-no\">216</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The normalized path.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"217\"><span class=\"c-no\">217</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"218\"><span class=\"c-no\">218</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.normpath(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"219\"><span class=\"c-no\">219</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"220\"><span class=\"c-no\">220</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> abspath(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str, *, cwd: str) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"221\"><span class=\"c-no\">221</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return an absolute, normalized version of ``path``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"222\"><span class=\"c-no\">222</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"223\"><span class=\"c-no\">223</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Unlike :func:`os.path.abspath`, this helper **never** reads</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"224\"><span class=\"c-no\">224</span><span class=\"c-src\">        the host process&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s working directory: when ``path`` is</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"225\"><span class=\"c-no\">225</span><span class=\"c-src\">        relative it <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> joined <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> the explicitly supplied ``cwd``,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"226\"><span class=\"c-no\">226</span><span class=\"c-src\">        which must itself be a path that <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> meaningful inside the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"227\"><span class=\"c-no\">227</span><span class=\"c-src\">        backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.  This avoids the silent bug where the</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"228\"><span class=\"c-no\">228</span><span class=\"c-src\">        host&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s ``os.getcwd()`` leaks into paths that will actually be</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"229\"><span class=\"c-no\">229</span><span class=\"c-src\">        used on a remote backend.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"230\"><span class=\"c-no\">230</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"231\"><span class=\"c-no\">231</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"232\"><span class=\"c-no\">232</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"233\"><span class=\"c-no\">233</span><span class=\"c-src\">                A path inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"234\"><span class=\"c-no\">234</span><span class=\"c-src\">            cwd (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"235\"><span class=\"c-no\">235</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Directory to resolve a relative ``path`` against.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"236\"><span class=\"c-no\">236</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Ignored when ``path`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> already absolute.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"237\"><span class=\"c-no\">237</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"238\"><span class=\"c-no\">238</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"239\"><span class=\"c-no\">239</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"240\"><span class=\"c-no\">240</span><span class=\"c-src\">                An absolute, normalized path.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"241\"><span class=\"c-no\">241</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"242\"><span class=\"c-no\">242</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.isabs(path):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"243\"><span class=\"c-no\">243</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.normpath(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"244\"><span class=\"c-no\">244</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.normpath(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"245\"><span class=\"c-no\">245</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.join(cwd, path),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"246\"><span class=\"c-no\">246</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"247\"><span class=\"c-no\">247</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"248\"><span class=\"c-no\">248</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ── abstract primitives ────────────────────────────────────────</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"249\"><span class=\"c-no\">249</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"250\"><span class=\"c-no\">250</span><span class=\"c-src\">    @abstractmethod</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"251\"><span class=\"c-no\">251</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> exec_shell(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"252\"><span class=\"c-no\">252</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"253\"><span class=\"c-no\">253</span><span class=\"c-src\">        command: list[str],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"254\"><span class=\"c-no\">254</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"255\"><span class=\"c-no\">255</span><span class=\"c-src\">        cwd: str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"256\"><span class=\"c-no\">256</span><span class=\"c-src\">        timeout: float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"257\"><span class=\"c-no\">257</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; ExecResult:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"258\"><span class=\"c-no\">258</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Run a program directly <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> an argument vector.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"259\"><span class=\"c-no\">259</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"260\"><span class=\"c-no\">260</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *command* <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> an executable followed by its arguments — it <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"261\"><span class=\"c-no\">261</span><span class=\"c-src\">        **<span class=\"c-kw\">not</span>** passed through a shell, so callers never have to quote</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"262\"><span class=\"c-no\">262</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> escape arguments <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> there <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> no platform-specific quoting</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"263\"><span class=\"c-no\">263</span><span class=\"c-src\">        bug. This makes the primitive portable to Windows, where POSIX</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"264\"><span class=\"c-no\">264</span><span class=\"c-src\">        single-quote escaping (``shlex.quote``) <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> understood by</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"265\"><span class=\"c-no\">265</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``cmd.exe``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"266\"><span class=\"c-no\">266</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"267\"><span class=\"c-no\">267</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Callers that genuinely need shell features (pipes, redirects,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"268\"><span class=\"c-no\">268</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``&amp;&amp;``) must wrap their command line explicitly, e.g.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"269\"><span class=\"c-no\">269</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;/bin/sh&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-c&quot;</span>, command_line]``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"270\"><span class=\"c-no\">270</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"271\"><span class=\"c-no\">271</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"272\"><span class=\"c-no\">272</span><span class=\"c-src\">            command (`list[str]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"273\"><span class=\"c-no\">273</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Executable path/name followed by its arguments.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"274\"><span class=\"c-no\">274</span><span class=\"c-src\">            cwd (`str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"275\"><span class=\"c-no\">275</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Working directory to run the command <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span>. When ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"276\"><span class=\"c-no\">276</span><span class=\"c-src\">                the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s default working directory is used.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"277\"><span class=\"c-no\">277</span><span class=\"c-src\">            timeout (`float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"278\"><span class=\"c-no\">278</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Maximum number of seconds to wait. When ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"279\"><span class=\"c-no\">279</span><span class=\"c-src\">                call waits indefinitely. On timeout the result carries</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"280\"><span class=\"c-no\">280</span><span class=\"c-src\">                an ``exit_code`` of ``-1``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"281\"><span class=\"c-no\">281</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"282\"><span class=\"c-no\">282</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"283\"><span class=\"c-no\">283</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `ExecResult`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"284\"><span class=\"c-no\">284</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The captured exit code, stdout, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> stderr.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"285\"><span class=\"c-no\">285</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"286\"><span class=\"c-no\">286</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"287\"><span class=\"c-no\">287</span><span class=\"c-src\">    @abstractmethod</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"288\"><span class=\"c-no\">288</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> read_file(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; bytes:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"289\"><span class=\"c-no\">289</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Read the full contents of ``path`` <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> raw bytes.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"290\"><span class=\"c-no\">290</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"291\"><span class=\"c-no\">291</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"292\"><span class=\"c-no\">292</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"293\"><span class=\"c-no\">293</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to the file inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"294\"><span class=\"c-no\">294</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"295\"><span class=\"c-no\">295</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"296\"><span class=\"c-no\">296</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bytes`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"297\"><span class=\"c-no\">297</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The raw file contents.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"298\"><span class=\"c-no\">298</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"299\"><span class=\"c-no\">299</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"300\"><span class=\"c-no\">300</span><span class=\"c-src\">    @abstractmethod</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"301\"><span class=\"c-no\">301</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> write_file(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str, data: bytes) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"302\"><span class=\"c-no\">302</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Write ``data`` to ``path``, creating parent directories.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"303\"><span class=\"c-no\">303</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"304\"><span class=\"c-no\">304</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"305\"><span class=\"c-no\">305</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"306\"><span class=\"c-no\">306</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Destination path inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"307\"><span class=\"c-no\">307</span><span class=\"c-src\">            data (`bytes`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"308\"><span class=\"c-no\">308</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The raw bytes to write.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"309\"><span class=\"c-no\">309</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"310\"><span class=\"c-no\">310</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"311\"><span class=\"c-no\">311</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># ── derived filesystem ops (shell-based defaults) ──────────────</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"312\"><span class=\"c-no\">312</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"313\"><span class=\"c-no\">313</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> getcwd(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"314\"><span class=\"c-no\">314</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return the backend environment&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s current working directory.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"315\"><span class=\"c-no\">315</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"316\"><span class=\"c-no\">316</span><span class=\"c-src\">        This <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> the directory that bare ``exec_shell`` invocations</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"317\"><span class=\"c-no\">317</span><span class=\"c-src\">        (those <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> ``cwd=<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>``) execute <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span>.  Tools should call this</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"318\"><span class=\"c-no\">318</span><span class=\"c-src\">        — instead of :func:`os.getcwd` — whenever they need a default</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"319\"><span class=\"c-no\">319</span><span class=\"c-src\">        path that <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> meaningful inside the backend, because the host</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"320\"><span class=\"c-no\">320</span><span class=\"c-src\">        process&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s cwd is meaningless for remote backends</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"321\"><span class=\"c-no\">321</span><span class=\"c-src\">        (Docker / E2B).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"322\"><span class=\"c-no\">322</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"323\"><span class=\"c-no\">323</span><span class=\"c-src\">        The default implementation runs ``pwd`` via :meth:`exec_shell`,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"324\"><span class=\"c-no\">324</span><span class=\"c-src\">        which works <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> any POSIX-like backend.  Backends <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> cheaper</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"325\"><span class=\"c-no\">325</span><span class=\"c-src\">        native access (e.g. :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`LocalBackend`, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> remote backends</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"326\"><span class=\"c-no\">326</span><span class=\"c-src\">        that already track their workdir) should override it.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"327\"><span class=\"c-no\">327</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"328\"><span class=\"c-no\">328</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"329\"><span class=\"c-no\">329</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"330\"><span class=\"c-no\">330</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s current working directory.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"331\"><span class=\"c-no\">331</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"332\"><span class=\"c-no\">332</span><span class=\"c-src\">        result = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.exec_shell([<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;pwd&quot;</span>])</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"333\"><span class=\"c-no\">333</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> result.stdout.decode(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>, errors=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;replace&quot;</span>).strip()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"334\"><span class=\"c-no\">334</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"335\"><span class=\"c-no\">335</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> expanduser(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"336\"><span class=\"c-no\">336</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Expand a leading ``~`` / ``~/`` to the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s home directory.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"337\"><span class=\"c-no\">337</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"338\"><span class=\"c-no\">338</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Tools should call this — instead of :func:`os.path.expanduser`</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"339\"><span class=\"c-no\">339</span><span class=\"c-src\">        — whenever they need to expand ``~`` <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> a path that lives</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"340\"><span class=\"c-no\">340</span><span class=\"c-src\">        inside the backend<span class=\"c-str\">&#x27;s environment, because the host process&#x27;</span>s</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"341\"><span class=\"c-no\">341</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``$HOME`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> meaningless <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> remote backends.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"342\"><span class=\"c-no\">342</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"343\"><span class=\"c-no\">343</span><span class=\"c-src\">        The default implementation queries ``$HOME`` via</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"344\"><span class=\"c-no\">344</span><span class=\"c-src\">        :meth:`exec_shell` (POSIX-only).  Only the leading ``~`` /</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"345\"><span class=\"c-no\">345</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``~/foo`` form <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> expanded; ``~user/...`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> supported by</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"346\"><span class=\"c-no\">346</span><span class=\"c-src\">        the default <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> returned unchanged.  Backends <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> cheaper</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"347\"><span class=\"c-no\">347</span><span class=\"c-src\">        native access should override (e.g. :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`LocalBackend`).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"348\"><span class=\"c-no\">348</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"349\"><span class=\"c-no\">349</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"350\"><span class=\"c-no\">350</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"351\"><span class=\"c-no\">351</span><span class=\"c-src\">                A path inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment, possibly</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"352\"><span class=\"c-no\">352</span><span class=\"c-src\">                starting <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> ``~``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"353\"><span class=\"c-no\">353</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"354\"><span class=\"c-no\">354</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"355\"><span class=\"c-no\">355</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"356\"><span class=\"c-no\">356</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``path`` <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> a leading ``~`` / ``~/`` expanded.  If</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"357\"><span class=\"c-no\">357</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``path`` does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> start <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> ``~``, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> starts <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"358\"><span class=\"c-no\">358</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``~user`` (unsupported), it <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> returned unchanged.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"359\"><span class=\"c-no\">359</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"360\"><span class=\"c-no\">360</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> path <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> path[0] != <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;~&quot;</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"361\"><span class=\"c-no\">361</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> path</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"362\"><span class=\"c-no\">362</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-com\"># ``~user/...`` form — not supported by the default impl.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"363\"><span class=\"c-no\">363</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> len(path) &gt; 1 <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> path[1] <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> (<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;/&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>._path_module.sep):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"364\"><span class=\"c-no\">364</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> path</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"365\"><span class=\"c-no\">365</span><span class=\"c-src\">        result = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.exec_shell([<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;printenv&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;HOME&quot;</span>])</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"366\"><span class=\"c-no\">366</span><span class=\"c-src\">        home = result.stdout.decode(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>, errors=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;replace&quot;</span>).strip()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"367\"><span class=\"c-no\">367</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> home:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"368\"><span class=\"c-no\">368</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> path</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"369\"><span class=\"c-no\">369</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> home + path[1:]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"370\"><span class=\"c-no\">370</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"371\"><span class=\"c-no\">371</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> file_exists(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"372\"><span class=\"c-no\">372</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ``path`` exists (file <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> directory).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"373\"><span class=\"c-no\">373</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"374\"><span class=\"c-no\">374</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"375\"><span class=\"c-no\">375</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"376\"><span class=\"c-no\">376</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to test inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"377\"><span class=\"c-no\">377</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"378\"><span class=\"c-no\">378</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"379\"><span class=\"c-no\">379</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bool`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"380\"><span class=\"c-no\">380</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> the path exists, ``<span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>`` otherwise.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"381\"><span class=\"c-no\">381</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"382\"><span class=\"c-no\">382</span><span class=\"c-src\">        result = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.exec_shell([<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;test&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-e&quot;</span>, path])</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"383\"><span class=\"c-no\">383</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> result.ok()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"384\"><span class=\"c-no\">384</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"385\"><span class=\"c-no\">385</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> is_dir(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"386\"><span class=\"c-no\">386</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ``path`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> an existing directory.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"387\"><span class=\"c-no\">387</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"388\"><span class=\"c-no\">388</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"389\"><span class=\"c-no\">389</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"390\"><span class=\"c-no\">390</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to test inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"391\"><span class=\"c-no\">391</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"392\"><span class=\"c-no\">392</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"393\"><span class=\"c-no\">393</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bool`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"394\"><span class=\"c-no\">394</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> the path <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> an existing directory.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"395\"><span class=\"c-no\">395</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"396\"><span class=\"c-no\">396</span><span class=\"c-src\">        result = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.exec_shell([<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;test&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-d&quot;</span>, path])</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"397\"><span class=\"c-no\">397</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> result.ok()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"398\"><span class=\"c-no\">398</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"399\"><span class=\"c-no\">399</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> list_dir(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"400\"><span class=\"c-no\">400</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"401\"><span class=\"c-no\">401</span><span class=\"c-src\">        path: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"402\"><span class=\"c-no\">402</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"403\"><span class=\"c-no\">403</span><span class=\"c-src\">        recursive: bool = <span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"404\"><span class=\"c-no\">404</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; list[str]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"405\"><span class=\"c-no\">405</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;List entries under ``path``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"406\"><span class=\"c-no\">406</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"407\"><span class=\"c-no\">407</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Output <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> NUL-delimited (``find -print0`` / ``-printf <span class=\"c-str\">&#x27;%f\\\\0&#x27;</span>``)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"408\"><span class=\"c-no\">408</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> split on ``\\\\0`` so that file names containing spaces <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"409\"><span class=\"c-no\">409</span><span class=\"c-src\">        newlines are handled correctly.  ``find -printf`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> a GNU</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"410\"><span class=\"c-no\">410</span><span class=\"c-src\">        extension; backends running on non-GNU userlands should override</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"411\"><span class=\"c-no\">411</span><span class=\"c-src\">        this method.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"412\"><span class=\"c-no\">412</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"413\"><span class=\"c-no\">413</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"414\"><span class=\"c-no\">414</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"415\"><span class=\"c-no\">415</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Directory to list inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"416\"><span class=\"c-no\">416</span><span class=\"c-src\">            recursive (`bool`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"417\"><span class=\"c-no\">417</span><span class=\"c-src\">                When ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>``, <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> all files underneath ``path`` <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"418\"><span class=\"c-no\">418</span><span class=\"c-src\">                paths (like ``find path -type f``). When ``<span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"419\"><span class=\"c-no\">419</span><span class=\"c-src\">                (default), <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> the immediate children&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s base names</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"420\"><span class=\"c-no\">420</span><span class=\"c-src\">                (like ``os.listdir``).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"421\"><span class=\"c-no\">421</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"422\"><span class=\"c-no\">422</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"423\"><span class=\"c-no\">423</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `list[str]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"424\"><span class=\"c-no\">424</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The matched entries, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> an empty list <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> ``path`` does</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"425\"><span class=\"c-no\">425</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> exist <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> cannot be listed.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"426\"><span class=\"c-no\">426</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"427\"><span class=\"c-no\">427</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> recursive:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"428\"><span class=\"c-no\">428</span><span class=\"c-src\">            command = [<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;find&quot;</span>, path, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-type&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;f&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-print0&quot;</span>]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"429\"><span class=\"c-no\">429</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"430\"><span class=\"c-no\">430</span><span class=\"c-src\">            command = [</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"431\"><span class=\"c-no\">431</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;find&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"432\"><span class=\"c-no\">432</span><span class=\"c-src\">                path,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"433\"><span class=\"c-no\">433</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-mindepth&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"434\"><span class=\"c-no\">434</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;1&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"435\"><span class=\"c-no\">435</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-maxdepth&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"436\"><span class=\"c-no\">436</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;1&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"437\"><span class=\"c-no\">437</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-printf&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"438\"><span class=\"c-no\">438</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;%f\\\\0&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"439\"><span class=\"c-no\">439</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"440\"><span class=\"c-no\">440</span><span class=\"c-src\">        result = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.exec_shell(command)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"441\"><span class=\"c-no\">441</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> result.ok():</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"442\"><span class=\"c-no\">442</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"443\"><span class=\"c-no\">443</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> [</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"444\"><span class=\"c-no\">444</span><span class=\"c-src\">            part.decode(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>, errors=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;surrogateescape&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"445\"><span class=\"c-no\">445</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> part <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> result.stdout.split(b<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;\\0&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"446\"><span class=\"c-no\">446</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> part</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"447\"><span class=\"c-no\">447</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ]</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"448\"><span class=\"c-no\">448</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"449\"><span class=\"c-no\">449</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> stat_mtime(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"450\"><span class=\"c-no\">450</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return the modification time of ``path``, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"451\"><span class=\"c-no\">451</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"452\"><span class=\"c-no\">452</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Tries GNU ``stat -c %Y`` first <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> falls back to BSD</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"453\"><span class=\"c-no\">453</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``stat -f %m`` so the same call works across coreutils <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"454\"><span class=\"c-no\">454</span><span class=\"c-src\">        BSD/macOS userlands.  The two attempts are combined <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> ``||``,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"455\"><span class=\"c-no\">455</span><span class=\"c-src\">        so this default wraps a ``sh -c`` script; backends without a</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"456\"><span class=\"c-no\">456</span><span class=\"c-src\">        POSIX shell (e.g. :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`LocalBackend`) override it.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"457\"><span class=\"c-no\">457</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"458\"><span class=\"c-no\">458</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"459\"><span class=\"c-no\">459</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"460\"><span class=\"c-no\">460</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to stat inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"461\"><span class=\"c-no\">461</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"462\"><span class=\"c-no\">462</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"463\"><span class=\"c-no\">463</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"464\"><span class=\"c-no\">464</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The modification time <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> a POSIX timestamp, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"465\"><span class=\"c-no\">465</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> the path does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> exist <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> cannot be stat&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;d.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"466\"><span class=\"c-no\">466</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"467\"><span class=\"c-no\">467</span><span class=\"c-src\">        quoted = shlex.quote(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"468\"><span class=\"c-no\">468</span><span class=\"c-src\">        script = (</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"469\"><span class=\"c-no\">469</span><span class=\"c-src\">            f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;stat -c %Y {quoted} 2&gt;/dev/null || &quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"470\"><span class=\"c-no\">470</span><span class=\"c-src\">            f<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;stat -f %m {quoted} 2&gt;/dev/null&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"471\"><span class=\"c-no\">471</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"472\"><span class=\"c-no\">472</span><span class=\"c-src\">        result = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.exec_shell([<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;sh&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-c&quot;</span>, script])</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"473\"><span class=\"c-no\">473</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> result.ok():</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"474\"><span class=\"c-no\">474</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"475\"><span class=\"c-no\">475</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"476\"><span class=\"c-no\">476</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> float(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"477\"><span class=\"c-no\">477</span><span class=\"c-src\">                result.stdout.decode(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>, errors=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;replace&quot;</span>).strip(),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"478\"><span class=\"c-no\">478</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"479\"><span class=\"c-no\">479</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> ValueError:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"480\"><span class=\"c-no\">480</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"481\"><span class=\"c-no\">481</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"482\"><span class=\"c-no\">482</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> delete_path(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"483\"><span class=\"c-no\">483</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Delete ``path`` (file <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> directory tree).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"484\"><span class=\"c-no\">484</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"485\"><span class=\"c-no\">485</span><span class=\"c-src\">        If ``path`` does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> exist the call <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> a silent no-op (like</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"486\"><span class=\"c-no\">486</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ``rm -rf``).  Handles both files <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> directories (recursively).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"487\"><span class=\"c-no\">487</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"488\"><span class=\"c-no\">488</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"489\"><span class=\"c-no\">489</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"490\"><span class=\"c-no\">490</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to delete inside the backend&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s environment.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"491\"><span class=\"c-no\">491</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"492\"><span class=\"c-no\">492</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>.exec_shell([<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;rm&quot;</span>, <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;-rf&quot;</span>, path])</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"493\"><span class=\"c-no\">493</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"494\"><span class=\"c-no\">494</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"495\"><span class=\"c-no\">495</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># ── local backend ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"496\"><span class=\"c-no\">496</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"497\"><span class=\"c-no\">497</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"498\"><span class=\"c-no\">498</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> _subprocess_creation_kwargs() -&gt; dict[str, Any]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"499\"><span class=\"c-no\">499</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return platform-specific subprocess creation options.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"500\"><span class=\"c-no\">500</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"501\"><span class=\"c-no\">501</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"502\"><span class=\"c-no\">502</span><span class=\"c-src\">        `dict[str, Any]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"503\"><span class=\"c-no\">503</span><span class=\"c-src\">            Extra keyword arguments <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> ``create_subprocess_shell``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"504\"><span class=\"c-no\">504</span><span class=\"c-src\">            Empty on POSIX; on Windows it sets ``creationflags`` to</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"505\"><span class=\"c-no\">505</span><span class=\"c-src\">            suppress a console window.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"506\"><span class=\"c-no\">506</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"507\"><span class=\"c-no\">507</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> os.name != <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;nt&quot;</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"508\"><span class=\"c-no\">508</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> {}</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"509\"><span class=\"c-no\">509</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"510\"><span class=\"c-no\">510</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> subprocess</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"511\"><span class=\"c-no\">511</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"512\"><span class=\"c-no\">512</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> {</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"513\"><span class=\"c-no\">513</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;creationflags&quot;</span>: getattr(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"514\"><span class=\"c-no\">514</span><span class=\"c-src\">            subprocess,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"515\"><span class=\"c-no\">515</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;CREATE_NO_WINDOW&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"516\"><span class=\"c-no\">516</span><span class=\"c-src\">            0x08000000,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"517\"><span class=\"c-no\">517</span><span class=\"c-src\">        ),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"518\"><span class=\"c-no\">518</span><span class=\"c-src\">    }</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"519\"><span class=\"c-no\">519</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"520\"><span class=\"c-no\">520</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"521\"><span class=\"c-no\">521</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> LocalBackend(BackendBase):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"522\"><span class=\"c-no\">522</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Host-local :<span class=\"c-kw\">class</span>:`BackendBase` implementation.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"523\"><span class=\"c-no\">523</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"524\"><span class=\"c-no\">524</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Uses ``asyncio.create_subprocess_exec``, ``aiofiles``, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"525\"><span class=\"c-no\">525</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ``os`` module.  This <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> the default backend injected when no</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"526\"><span class=\"c-no\">526</span><span class=\"c-src\">    explicit one <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> given to a builtin tool.  Commands are spawned</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"527\"><span class=\"c-no\">527</span><span class=\"c-src\">    directly <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> their argument vector (no shell), which avoids the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"528\"><span class=\"c-no\">528</span><span class=\"c-src\">    POSIX-vs-``cmd.exe`` quoting mismatch <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> makes the backend work on</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"529\"><span class=\"c-no\">529</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Windows.  The derived filesystem helpers are overridden <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> native</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"530\"><span class=\"c-no\">530</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ``os.*`` calls — faster <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> more robust than shelling out, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"531\"><span class=\"c-no\">531</span><span class=\"c-src\">    portable to Windows where ``test`` / ``find`` / ``stat`` are</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"532\"><span class=\"c-no\">532</span><span class=\"c-src\">    unavailable.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"533\"><span class=\"c-no\">533</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"534\"><span class=\"c-no\">534</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"535\"><span class=\"c-no\">535</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># Use the host OS&#x27;s path semantics (Windows or POSIX) instead of</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"536\"><span class=\"c-no\">536</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># the base class default (``posixpath``), so path helpers behave</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"537\"><span class=\"c-no\">537</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-com\"># correctly when running on a Windows host.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"538\"><span class=\"c-no\">538</span><span class=\"c-src\">    _path_module = os.path</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"539\"><span class=\"c-no\">539</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"540\"><span class=\"c-no\">540</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> exec_shell(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"541\"><span class=\"c-no\">541</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"542\"><span class=\"c-no\">542</span><span class=\"c-src\">        command: list[str],</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"543\"><span class=\"c-no\">543</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"544\"><span class=\"c-no\">544</span><span class=\"c-src\">        cwd: str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"545\"><span class=\"c-no\">545</span><span class=\"c-src\">        timeout: float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span> = <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"546\"><span class=\"c-no\">546</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; ExecResult:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"547\"><span class=\"c-no\">547</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Run a program via ``asyncio.create_subprocess_exec``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"548\"><span class=\"c-no\">548</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"549\"><span class=\"c-no\">549</span><span class=\"c-src\">        The program <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> spawned directly <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> *command* without an</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"550\"><span class=\"c-no\">550</span><span class=\"c-src\">        intervening shell, so no argument quoting <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> required <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"551\"><span class=\"c-no\">551</span><span class=\"c-src\">        same code path works on POSIX <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> Windows.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"552\"><span class=\"c-no\">552</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"553\"><span class=\"c-no\">553</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"554\"><span class=\"c-no\">554</span><span class=\"c-src\">            command (`list[str]`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"555\"><span class=\"c-no\">555</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Executable path/name followed by its arguments.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"556\"><span class=\"c-no\">556</span><span class=\"c-src\">            cwd (`str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"557\"><span class=\"c-no\">557</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Working directory <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> the subprocess. When ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`` the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"558\"><span class=\"c-no\">558</span><span class=\"c-src\">                current process working directory <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> used.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"559\"><span class=\"c-no\">559</span><span class=\"c-src\">            timeout (`float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"560\"><span class=\"c-no\">560</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Maximum number of seconds to wait before the process <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"561\"><span class=\"c-no\">561</span><span class=\"c-src\">                killed <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> an ``exit_code`` of ``-1`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> returned.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"562\"><span class=\"c-no\">562</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"563\"><span class=\"c-no\">563</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"564\"><span class=\"c-no\">564</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `ExecResult`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"565\"><span class=\"c-no\">565</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The captured exit code, stdout, <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> stderr. If the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"566\"><span class=\"c-no\">566</span><span class=\"c-src\">                executable cannot be found <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> spawned, ``exit_code`` <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"567\"><span class=\"c-no\">567</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``127`` (matching a shell&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s \u0000159\u0000), with</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"568\"><span class=\"c-no\">568</span><span class=\"c-src\">                the OS error message on stderr.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"569\"><span class=\"c-no\">569</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"570\"><span class=\"c-no\">570</span><span class=\"c-src\">        kwargs = _subprocess_creation_kwargs()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"571\"><span class=\"c-no\">571</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> cwd <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"572\"><span class=\"c-no\">572</span><span class=\"c-src\">            kwargs[<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;cwd&quot;</span>] = cwd</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"573\"><span class=\"c-no\">573</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"574\"><span class=\"c-no\">574</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"575\"><span class=\"c-no\">575</span><span class=\"c-src\">            process = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> asyncio.create_subprocess_exec(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"576\"><span class=\"c-no\">576</span><span class=\"c-src\">                *command,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"577\"><span class=\"c-no\">577</span><span class=\"c-src\">                stdout=asyncio.subprocess.PIPE,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"578\"><span class=\"c-no\">578</span><span class=\"c-src\">                stderr=asyncio.subprocess.PIPE,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"579\"><span class=\"c-no\">579</span><span class=\"c-src\">                **kwargs,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"580\"><span class=\"c-no\">580</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"581\"><span class=\"c-no\">581</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> (FileNotFoundError, NotADirectoryError, OSError) <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> exc:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"582\"><span class=\"c-no\">582</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># The executable could not be found or spawned. A shell would</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"583\"><span class=\"c-no\">583</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># have returned 127 (\u0000164\u0000); mirror that so</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"584\"><span class=\"c-no\">584</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># callers see a normal non-zero ExecResult instead of an</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"585\"><span class=\"c-no\">585</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-com\"># exception.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"586\"><span class=\"c-no\">586</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> ExecResult(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"587\"><span class=\"c-no\">587</span><span class=\"c-src\">                exit_code=127,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"588\"><span class=\"c-no\">588</span><span class=\"c-src\">                stdout=b<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"589\"><span class=\"c-no\">589</span><span class=\"c-src\">                stderr=str(exc).encode(<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"590\"><span class=\"c-no\">590</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"591\"><span class=\"c-no\">591</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"592\"><span class=\"c-no\">592</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"593\"><span class=\"c-no\">593</span><span class=\"c-src\">            stdout, stderr = <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> asyncio.wait_for(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"594\"><span class=\"c-no\">594</span><span class=\"c-src\">                process.communicate(),</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"595\"><span class=\"c-no\">595</span><span class=\"c-src\">                timeout=timeout,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"596\"><span class=\"c-no\">596</span><span class=\"c-src\">            )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"597\"><span class=\"c-no\">597</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> asyncio.TimeoutError:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"598\"><span class=\"c-no\">598</span><span class=\"c-src\">            process.kill()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"599\"><span class=\"c-no\">599</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> process.communicate()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"600\"><span class=\"c-no\">600</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> ExecResult(exit_code=-1, stdout=b<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>, stderr=b<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;timed out&quot;</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"601\"><span class=\"c-no\">601</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"602\"><span class=\"c-no\">602</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> ExecResult(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"603\"><span class=\"c-no\">603</span><span class=\"c-src\">            exit_code=process.returncode <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> 0,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"604\"><span class=\"c-no\">604</span><span class=\"c-src\">            stdout=stdout,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"605\"><span class=\"c-no\">605</span><span class=\"c-src\">            stderr=stderr,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"606\"><span class=\"c-no\">606</span><span class=\"c-src\">        )</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"607\"><span class=\"c-no\">607</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"608\"><span class=\"c-no\">608</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> read_file(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; bytes:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"609\"><span class=\"c-no\">609</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Read a local file <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> raw bytes.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"610\"><span class=\"c-no\">610</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"611\"><span class=\"c-no\">611</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"612\"><span class=\"c-no\">612</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"613\"><span class=\"c-no\">613</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to the local file.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"614\"><span class=\"c-no\">614</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"615\"><span class=\"c-no\">615</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"616\"><span class=\"c-no\">616</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bytes`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"617\"><span class=\"c-no\">617</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The raw file contents.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"618\"><span class=\"c-no\">618</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"619\"><span class=\"c-no\">619</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> aiofiles.open(path, mode=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;rb&quot;</span>) <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> f:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"620\"><span class=\"c-no\">620</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> f.read()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"621\"><span class=\"c-no\">621</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"622\"><span class=\"c-no\">622</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> write_file(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str, data: bytes) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"623\"><span class=\"c-no\">623</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Write *data* to a local file, creating parent dirs.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"624\"><span class=\"c-no\">624</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"625\"><span class=\"c-no\">625</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"626\"><span class=\"c-no\">626</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"627\"><span class=\"c-no\">627</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Destination path on the local filesystem.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"628\"><span class=\"c-no\">628</span><span class=\"c-src\">            data (`bytes`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"629\"><span class=\"c-no\">629</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The raw bytes to write.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"630\"><span class=\"c-no\">630</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"631\"><span class=\"c-no\">631</span><span class=\"c-src\">        parent = os.path.dirname(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"632\"><span class=\"c-no\">632</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> parent:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"633\"><span class=\"c-no\">633</span><span class=\"c-src\">            os.makedirs(parent, exist_ok=<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"634\"><span class=\"c-no\">634</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> aiofiles.open(path, mode=<span class=\"c-str\">&quot;wb&quot;</span>) <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> f:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"635\"><span class=\"c-no\">635</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">await</span> f.write(data)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"636\"><span class=\"c-no\">636</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"637\"><span class=\"c-no\">637</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> getcwd(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"638\"><span class=\"c-no\">638</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return the host process&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s current working directory.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"639\"><span class=\"c-no\">639</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"640\"><span class=\"c-no\">640</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"641\"><span class=\"c-no\">641</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"642\"><span class=\"c-no\">642</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``os.getcwd()`` — avoids spawning a ``pwd`` subprocess.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"643\"><span class=\"c-no\">643</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"644\"><span class=\"c-no\">644</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> os.getcwd()</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"645\"><span class=\"c-no\">645</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"646\"><span class=\"c-no\">646</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> expanduser(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; str:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"647\"><span class=\"c-no\">647</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Expand ``~`` using the host process&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s ``$HOME``.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"648\"><span class=\"c-no\">648</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"649\"><span class=\"c-no\">649</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"650\"><span class=\"c-no\">650</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"651\"><span class=\"c-no\">651</span><span class=\"c-src\">                A local path, possibly starting <span class=\"c-kw\">with</span> ``~``.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"652\"><span class=\"c-no\">652</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"653\"><span class=\"c-no\">653</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"654\"><span class=\"c-no\">654</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `str`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"655\"><span class=\"c-no\">655</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``os.path.expanduser(path)`` — avoids spawning a</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"656\"><span class=\"c-no\">656</span><span class=\"c-src\">                subprocess.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"657\"><span class=\"c-no\">657</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"658\"><span class=\"c-no\">658</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> os.path.expanduser(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"659\"><span class=\"c-no\">659</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"660\"><span class=\"c-no\">660</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> file_exists(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"661\"><span class=\"c-no\">661</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Check <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> a local path exists.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"662\"><span class=\"c-no\">662</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"663\"><span class=\"c-no\">663</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"664\"><span class=\"c-no\">664</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"665\"><span class=\"c-no\">665</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to test.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"666\"><span class=\"c-no\">666</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"667\"><span class=\"c-no\">667</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"668\"><span class=\"c-no\">668</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bool`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"669\"><span class=\"c-no\">669</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> the path exists.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"670\"><span class=\"c-no\">670</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"671\"><span class=\"c-no\">671</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> os.path.exists(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"672\"><span class=\"c-no\">672</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"673\"><span class=\"c-no\">673</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> is_dir(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"674\"><span class=\"c-no\">674</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Check <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> a local path <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> a directory.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"675\"><span class=\"c-no\">675</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"676\"><span class=\"c-no\">676</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"677\"><span class=\"c-no\">677</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"678\"><span class=\"c-no\">678</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to test.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"679\"><span class=\"c-no\">679</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"680\"><span class=\"c-no\">680</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"681\"><span class=\"c-no\">681</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `bool`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"682\"><span class=\"c-no\">682</span><span class=\"c-src\">                ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>`` <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> the path <span class=\"c-kw\">is</span> an existing directory.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"683\"><span class=\"c-no\">683</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"684\"><span class=\"c-no\">684</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> os.path.isdir(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"685\"><span class=\"c-no\">685</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"686\"><span class=\"c-no\">686</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> list_dir(</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"687\"><span class=\"c-no\">687</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"688\"><span class=\"c-no\">688</span><span class=\"c-src\">        path: str,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"689\"><span class=\"c-no\">689</span><span class=\"c-src\">        *,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"690\"><span class=\"c-no\">690</span><span class=\"c-src\">        recursive: bool = <span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>,</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"691\"><span class=\"c-no\">691</span><span class=\"c-src\">    ) -&gt; list[str]:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"692\"><span class=\"c-no\">692</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;List local directory entries.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"693\"><span class=\"c-no\">693</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"694\"><span class=\"c-no\">694</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Mirrors the base contract using native ``os`` calls.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"695\"><span class=\"c-no\">695</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"696\"><span class=\"c-no\">696</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"697\"><span class=\"c-no\">697</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"698\"><span class=\"c-no\">698</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Directory to list.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"699\"><span class=\"c-no\">699</span><span class=\"c-src\">            recursive (`bool`, optional):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"700\"><span class=\"c-no\">700</span><span class=\"c-src\">                When ``<span class=\"c-kw\">True</span>``, <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> file paths underneath ``path``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"701\"><span class=\"c-no\">701</span><span class=\"c-src\">                (``os.walk``). When ``<span class=\"c-kw\">False</span>`` (default), <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> the</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"702\"><span class=\"c-no\">702</span><span class=\"c-src\">                immediate children&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;s base names (``os.listdir``).</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"703\"><span class=\"c-no\">703</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"704\"><span class=\"c-no\">704</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"705\"><span class=\"c-no\">705</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `list[str]`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"706\"><span class=\"c-no\">706</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The matched entries.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"707\"><span class=\"c-no\">707</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"708\"><span class=\"c-no\">708</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> recursive:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"709\"><span class=\"c-no\">709</span><span class=\"c-src\">            results: list[str] = []</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"710\"><span class=\"c-no\">710</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> root, _dirs, files <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> os.walk(path):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"711\"><span class=\"c-no\">711</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> f <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> files:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"712\"><span class=\"c-no\">712</span><span class=\"c-src\">                    results.append(os.path.join(root, f))</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"713\"><span class=\"c-no\">713</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> results</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"714\"><span class=\"c-no\">714</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> os.listdir(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"715\"><span class=\"c-no\">715</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"716\"><span class=\"c-no\">716</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> stat_mtime(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"717\"><span class=\"c-no\">717</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Return the modification time of a local file.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"718\"><span class=\"c-no\">718</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"719\"><span class=\"c-no\">719</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"720\"><span class=\"c-no\">720</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"721\"><span class=\"c-no\">721</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to stat.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"722\"><span class=\"c-no\">722</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"723\"><span class=\"c-no\">723</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"724\"><span class=\"c-no\">724</span><span class=\"c-src\">            `float | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>`:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"725\"><span class=\"c-no\">725</span><span class=\"c-src\">                The modification time <span class=\"c-kw\">as</span> a POSIX timestamp, <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> ``<span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>``</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"726\"><span class=\"c-no\">726</span><span class=\"c-src\">                <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> the path does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> exist <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> cannot be stat&<span class=\"c-com\">#x27;d.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"727\"><span class=\"c-no\">727</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"728\"><span class=\"c-no\">728</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"729\"><span class=\"c-no\">729</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> os.stat(path).st_mtime</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"730\"><span class=\"c-no\">730</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> (OSError, FileNotFoundError):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"731\"><span class=\"c-no\">731</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"732\"><span class=\"c-no\">732</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"733\"><span class=\"c-no\">733</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">async</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> delete_path(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>, path: str) -&gt; <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"734\"><span class=\"c-no\">734</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Delete a local file <span class=\"c-kw\">or</span> directory tree.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"735\"><span class=\"c-no\">735</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"736\"><span class=\"c-no\">736</span><span class=\"c-src\">        No-op <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> *path* does <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> exist.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"737\"><span class=\"c-no\">737</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"738\"><span class=\"c-no\">738</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"739\"><span class=\"c-no\">739</span><span class=\"c-src\">            path (`str`):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"740\"><span class=\"c-no\">740</span><span class=\"c-src\">                Path to delete.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"741\"><span class=\"c-no\">741</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"742\"><span class=\"c-no\">742</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> os.path.exists(path):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"743\"><span class=\"c-no\">743</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"744\"><span class=\"c-no\">744</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> os.path.isdir(path):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"745\"><span class=\"c-no\">745</span><span class=\"c-src\">            shutil.rmtree(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"746\"><span class=\"c-no\">746</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">else</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"747\"><span class=\"c-no\">747</span><span class=\"c-src\">            os.remove(path)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"748\"><span class=\"c-no\">748</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>", "lines": 748, "explanation": "_backend.py 来自 agentscope/QwenPaw 框架源码。结合左侧源码与右侧知识点理解此处设计意图；点「反向链接」可回到引用它的教程章节。", "knowledge_points": [], "related_docs": ["W06-工具体系与MCP"]};
